    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557130/extras/b50c8aa9dc12c415219cb04490bd204a.poster.avif?t=1746218542\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557130/extras/b50c8aa9dc12c415219cb04490bd204a.webm?t=1746218542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557130/extras/b50c8aa9dc12c415219cb04490bd204a.mp4?t=1746218542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise of the Inferno comes with the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling story with emotional dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Immersive World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic pixel-art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with Steam Deck for a great handheld experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming soon! Prepare yourself to face an ancient evil from beyond the <strong>Traverse</strong>...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557130/extras/b50c8aa9dc12c415219cb04490bd204a.poster.avif?t=1746218542\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557130/extras/b50c8aa9dc12c415219cb04490bd204a.webm?t=1746218542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557130/extras/b50c8aa9dc12c415219cb04490bd204a.mp4?t=1746218542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise of the Inferno comes with the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling story with emotional dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Immersive World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic pixel-art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with Steam Deck for a great handheld experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming soon! Prepare yourself to face an ancient evil from beyond the <strong>Traverse</strong>...</p>",
    "short_description": "Rise of the Inferno is a 2-D story-based RPG where two best friends are tasked with teleporting across different worlds to save their beloved kingdom. Join Albert and John on their grand adventure as they fight the evil forces of the Inferno pursuant on destroying their world.",
